# The catalogues are reachable ONLY through /api/i18n/{locale}, which applies
# the locale enum whitelist, the admin gate for the write path, and the JSON
# encoding flags. Serving them as static files would bypass all three and would
# also let a directory listing enumerate every translation in one request.
Require all denied
<IfModule !mod_authz_core.c>
    Order allow,deny
    Deny from all
</IfModule>
Options -Indexes
